&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 2.5pt 0in 2.5pt 0; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong attention to data quality, lineage integrity, and pipeline observability, with the ability to work independently and drive technical outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;border-style: none; margin: 15.0pt 0in 5.0pt; padding: 0in;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Success Criteria&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ck-list-marker-font-size ck-list-marker-color ck-list-marker-font-family&quot; data-list-item-id=&quot;eeb619e76de48ad30ea9da0d0e875e81c&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 2.5pt 0in 2.5pt 0; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Establish and document the shared GCP native pipeline architecture before domain connector builds begin.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ck-list-marker-font-size ck-list-marker-color ck-list-marker-font-family&quot; data-list-item-id=&quot;e1b779974f4c0ad7506fb38768f8601ed&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 2.5pt 0in 2.5pt 0; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Deliver both the Workday and Oracle connectors on schedule, producing validated, lineage stamped data to Cloud SQL.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ck-list-marker-font-size ck-list-marker-color ck-list-marker-font-family&quot; data-list-item-id=&quot;e9be728a01554a3c82ff3afdb83716b02&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 2.5pt 0in 2.5pt 0; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Implement a unified data model supporting all three reporting lenses from a single join layer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
