&lt;li class=&quot;ck-list-marker-font-size ck-list-marker-color ck-list-marker-font-family&quot; data-list-item-id=&quot;eefd02419fa605c2d41b87d2dd04ff12c&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 2.5pt 0in 2.5pt 0; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Stand up the lineage graph, enabling any dashboard metric to be traced to its originating source record.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
